    {"en":"Uncle Vernon rapped the glass smartly with his knuckles, but the snake just snoozed on.","zh":"弗农姨父用指关节清脆地叩击着玻璃，但那条蛇只是继续呼呼大睡。","audio":"./audio/dale-ch2/0161.mp3","links":[[0,12,0,4],[13,19,11,13],[24,29,14,16],[30,37,8,11],[47,55,5,8],[65,70,20,21],[76,86,23,29]]}
